# Application properties overridden for this bench, one KEY=value per line.
#
# In Lutece 8 AppPropertiesService reads MicroProfile Config. Its environment source outranks every .properties
# file of the assembled site, so this is how a bench changes a property without touching the artefact under test.
# The key is the property name upper-cased with every non-alphanumeric character replaced by an underscore:
#
#   limitconnectedusers.maxConnectedUsers   ->   LIMITCONNECTEDUSERS_MAXCONNECTEDUSERS=30
#
# Shipped empty on purpose: a value here changes how the application behaves, so every line needs a reason.
